---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="about-section">
  <div class="content-container">
    <div class="about-frame">
      <SectionHeading
        title="About the Competition"
      />

      <div class="about-body">
        <p class="about-lead">
          The <strong>Daniel H. Plotnick Memorial Computing Competition (DHPMCC)</strong> is an in-person competitive programming tournament hosted at <strong>Bergen County Academies</strong> in Hackensack, New Jersey.
        </p>
        <p class="about-text">
          Competitors work individually through a series of original algorithmic problems, developing and implementing solutions within fixed time and memory constraints. The competition emphasizes problem solving, algorithmic reasoning, and efficient implementation.
        </p>
        <p class="about-text">
          The tournament is held in memory of <strong>Daniel H. Plotnick</strong>, a beloved BCA Math Team coach celebrated for his kindness, dedication, and caring mentorship. We honor his enduring legacy by fostering the same curiosity and passion for problem solving that he inspired in every student.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 6rem 0;
  }

  /* Framed panel matching modern hackathons */
  .about-frame {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 3.5rem 3.5rem 3.25rem 3.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 25px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-frame :global(.section-header) {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-body {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #1e293b;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .about-text {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #475569;
    margin: 0 0 1.35rem 0;
  }

  .about-text:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-text strong,
  .about-lead strong {
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-section {
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }

    .about-frame {
      padding: 2.25rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .about-lead {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .about-text {
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }
  }
</style>
